<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-075" chapter-id="c-jinshu-075-wyg-xunrui" source-id="s-jinshu-075-wyg-xunrui">
  <p id="c-jinshu-075-wyg-xunrui:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-075-wyg-xunrui:p001:m0000" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABAAAA">蕤</persName>字<persName id="c-jinshu-075-wyg-xunrui:p001:m0002" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABAAAA">令逺</persName>起家祕書郎稍遷尚書左丞<persName id="c-jinshu-075-wyg-xunrui:p001:m0015" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABAAAA">蕤</persName>有儀操風望雅為<persName id="c-jinshu-075-wyg-xunrui:p001:m0023" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAF">簡文帝</persName>所重時<persName id="c-jinshu-075-wyg-xunrui:p001:m0029" ref="8uq_4jd_30f">桓温</persName>平蜀朝廷欲以豫章郡封<persName id="c-jinshu-075-wyg-xunrui:p001:m0041" ref="8uq_4jd_30f">溫</persName><persName id="c-jinshu-075-wyg-xunrui:p001:m0042" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABAAAA">蕤</persName>言於<persName id="c-jinshu-075-wyg-xunrui:p001:m0045" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAF">帝</persName>曰若<persName id="c-jinshu-075-wyg-xunrui:p001:m0048" ref="8uq_4jd_30f">温</persName>復假王威北平河洛修復園陵將何以加此於是乃止轉散騎常侍少府不拜出補東陽太守除建威将軍吳國内史卒官子<persName id="c-jinshu-075-wyg-xunrui:p001:m0097" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABAAAAA">籍</persName>嗣位至散騎常侍大長秋</p>
</text>
